  <h1 class="title">Equity in Athletics</h1>


          </div>
  </div>


  <div id="block-system-main-block" class="block block-system block-system-main-block clearfix">
    <div class="block-inner">
      
            

              <div data-history-node-id="2662" class="node node--type-page node--view-mode-full ds-1col clearfix">

  

  <div class="field field-name-field-subtitle">The Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) requires colleges and universities that participate in intercollegiate athletic programs and provide federal financial aid assistance to file this annual report to the U. S. Department of Education detailing athletic participation, staffing, and revenues and expenses for men&#039;s, women&#039;s, and coed teams.  This data is then used to inform Congress on gender equity in college athletics.  </div>

            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item"><div id="accordion_3" class=" accordion"><div id class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#panel_25f96d41cd307e02f0b075420ffac1aa" class="collapsed" role="button">Equity in Athletics <strong>2026</strong> Institution Information<div class="toggle-icon"></div></a></h3></div><div id="panel_25f96d41cd307e02f0b075420ffac1aa" class="panel-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion_3"><div class="panel-body"><table width="517"><thead><tr><th colspan="2"><strong>REGISTRATION</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First Name</td><td>Leslie</td></tr><tr><td>Last Name</td><td>Weinsheim</td></tr><tr><td>Title</td><td>Director of Institutional Research, Planning &amp; Development</td></tr><tr><td>Institution</td><td>Northeastern Junior College</td></tr><tr><td>Address</td><td>100 College Avenue</td></tr><tr><td>City</td><td>Sterling</td></tr><tr><td>State</td><td>Colorado</td></tr><tr><td>Zip</td><td>80751</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td>970-521-6714</td></tr><tr><td>Fax</td><td>970-522-4945</td></tr><tr><td>E-Mail</td><td><a href="mailto:leslie.weinsheim@njc.edu">leslie.weinsheim@njc.edu</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><table width="535"><thead><tr><th colspan="2">IDENTIFICATION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General Information</strong></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Institution Name</td><td>Northeastern Junior College</td></tr><tr><td>Address</td><td>100 College Avenue</td></tr><tr><td>City</td><td>Sterling</td></tr><tr><td>State</td><td>Colorado</td></tr><tr><td>Zip Code</td><td>80751</td></tr><tr><td>Telephone</td><td>970-521-6600</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Athletic Department</strong></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Athletic Director Name</td><td>Eddie Trenkle</td></tr><tr><td>Address</td><td>100 College Avenue</td></tr><tr><td>City</td><td>Sterling</td></tr><tr><td>State</td><td>Colorado</td></tr><tr><td>Zip Code</td><td>80751</td></tr><tr><td>Telephone</td><td>970-521-6617</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chief Administrative Officer</strong></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Chief Administrative Officer's Name</td><td>Mike White</td></tr><tr><td>Title</td><td>President</td></tr><tr><td>Telephone</td><td>970-521-7000</td></tr><tr><td>Fax</td><td>970-522-4945</td></tr><tr><td>E-Mail Address</td><td><a href="mailto:mike.white@njc.edu">mike.white@njc.edu</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h4><strong>General</strong></h4><h4>Designated Reporting Year</h4><p><strong>Begins:</strong>&nbsp; 07/01/2025&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Ends:</strong>&nbsp; 06/30/2026</p></div></div></div><div id class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#panel_735ca64c4f85ea8181a453c3e7a3da9b" class="collapsed" role="button">Number of full time undergraduates by gender:<div class="toggle-icon"></div></a></h3></div><div id="panel_735ca64c4f85ea8181a453c3e7a3da9b" class="panel-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion_3"><div class="panel-body"><h4>The numbers below were reported on your institution's 2025-2026 IPEDS Survey and should not be changed unless they were reported incorrectly to IPEDS.&nbsp; If the numbers are incorrect, please call the EADA Help Desk to correct them.</h4><table width="670"><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><strong>Number</strong></td><td><strong>Percent</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Male full time undergraduates</td><td>297</td><td>48%</td></tr><tr><td>Female full time undergraduates</td><td>318</td><td>52%</td></tr><tr><td>Total full time undergraduates</td><td>615</td><td>100%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#panel_060fe14cfafac6acc6931c13398d24a1" class="collapsed" role="button">Athletic Sanctioning Body for the designated reporting year:<div class="toggle-icon"></div></a></h3></div><div id="panel_060fe14cfafac6acc6931c13398d24a1" class="panel-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion_3"><div class="panel-body"><table width="669"><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division I-FBS</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NAIA Division I</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division I-FCS</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NAIA Division II</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division I without Football</td><td><strong>X</strong></td><td>NJCAA Division I</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division II with Football</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NJCAA Division II</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division II without Football</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NJCAA Division III</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division III with Football</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCCAA Division I</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCAA Division III without Football</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NCCAA Division II</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>CCCAA</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NWAC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Independent</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USCAA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Other</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><h4>Update Status</h4><p><strong>Date Completed:&nbsp; 10/14/2026</strong></p><p><strong>Update Status: updated</strong></p></div></div></div></div><h3>Screening Questions</h3><div id="accordion_4" class=" accordion"><div id class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#panel_49064fb52621bbb25aac78463b820222" class="collapsed" role="button">How will you report Operating (Game-Day) Expenses?<div class="toggle-icon"></div></a></h3></div><div id="panel_49064fb52621bbb25aac78463b820222" class="panel-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion_4"><div class="panel-body"><table width="392"><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>By Team</td><td><strong>X</strong></td><td>Per Participant</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id class="panel panel-default"><div class